Package: msu
Title: Multivariate Symmetric Uncertainty and Other Measurements
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: c(person("Gustavo", "Sosa", email = "gsosa.py@gmail.com",
    role = "aut"), person("Elias", "Maciel", email =
    "eliasmacielr@gmail.com", role = "cre"))
Description: Estimators for multivariate symmetrical uncertainty based
    on the work of Gustavo Sosa et al. (2016)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1709.08730>, total correlation, information gain
    and symmetrical uncertainty of categorical variables.
